https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766700/extras/c465f6e01600c620ade5f8857f4e8a56.poster.avif?t=1760110131\" width=930 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766700/extras/c465f6e01600c620ade5f8857f4e8a56.webm?t=1760110131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766700/extras/c465f6e01600c620ade5f8857f4e8a56.mp4?t=1760110131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm is full of traps, fire gets, electrical fences, and worse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goats headbutt, horses kick, and chickens launch eggs like mortars, often at the worst possible moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden chicks, risky shortcuts, and off-path secrets if you\u2019re bold (or desperate) enough to look.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for fans of physical comedy, stealthy chaos, and movement that fights back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark\u2019s not graceful. Mark\u2019s not smart. Mark doesn\u2019t have a head. But he might make it.</p></p>","developers":["AppleBomb Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766700/06022019f49ffa70ebaf17a4c556d1280d2d7810/header.jpg?t=1760110131","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3766700/1394556759/65a736e4dc55da1568cfc51a4993c52e47210c8a/1760109724/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760110129","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3766700/1394556759/65a736e4dc55da1568cfc51a4993c52e47210c8a/1760109724/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760110129","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video